ess\\\"}],\\\"name\\\":\\\"setGuardian\\\",\\\"outputs\\\":[],\\\"stateMutability\\\":\\\"nonpayable\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"function\\\"},{\\\"inputs\\\":[{\\\"internalType\\\":\\\"address\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"sender\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"address\\\"},{\\\"internalType\\\":\\\"address\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"asset\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"address\\\"},{\\\"components\\\":[{\\\"internalType\\\":\\\"uint128\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"dvtTriggerAmount\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"uint128\\\"},{\\\"internalType\\\":\\\"uint128\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"perTxHardCap\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"uint128\\\"},{\\\"internalType\\\":\\\"uint256\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"dailyLimit\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"uint256\\\"},{\\\"internalType\\\":\\\"uint64\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"windowSeconds\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"uint64\\\"}],\\\"internalType\\\":\\\"struct IPolicyRegistry.AssetPolicyInput\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"params\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"tuple\\\"}],\\\"name\\\":\\\"tightenAssetPolicy\\\",\\\"outputs\\\":[],\\\"stateMutability\\\":\\\"nonpayable\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"function\\\"},{\\\"inputs\\\":[{\\\"internalType\\\":\\\"address\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"sender\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"address\\\"},{\\\"internalType\\\":\\\"address\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"target\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"address\\\"},{\\\"components\\\":[{\\\"internalType\\\":\\\"bool\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"allowed\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"bool\\\"},{\\\"internalType\\\":\\\"bool\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"requireDVTAlways\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"bool\\\"},{\\\"internalType\\\":\\\"uint128\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"velocityLimit\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"uint128\\\"},{\\\"internalType\\\":\\\"uint64\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"velocityWindow\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"uint64\\\"},{\\\"internalType\\\":\\\"bytes4[]\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"selectorAllowlist\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"bytes4[]\\\"}],\\\"internalType\\\":\\\"struct IPolicyRegistry.ContractScopeInput\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"params\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"tuple\\\"}],\\\"name\\\":\\\"tightenContractScope\\\",\\\"outputs\\\":[],\\\"stateMutability\\\":\\\"nonpayable\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"function\\\"},{\\\"inputs\\\":[],\\\"name\\\":\\\"timelock\\\",\\\"outputs\\\":[{\\\"internalType\\\":\\\"address\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"address\\\"}],\\\"stateMutability\\\":\\\"view\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"function\\\"},{\\\"inputs\\\":[{\\\"internalType\\\":\\\"address\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"sender\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"address\\\"}],\\\"name\\\":\\\"unfreezeSender\\\",\\\"outputs\\\":[],\\\"stateMutability\\\":\\\"nonpayable\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"function\\\"},{\\\"inputs\\\":[],\\\"name\\\":\\\"version\\\",\\\"outputs\\\":[{\\\"internalType\\\":\\\"string\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\"}],\\\"stateMutability\\\":\\\"pure\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"function\\\"}],\\\"devdoc\\\":{\\\"author\\\":\\\"SuperPaymaster (DVT cross-repo program, hub: AAStarCommunity/YetAnotherAA-Validator#42)\\\",\\\"details\\\":\\\"UPGRADEABILITY DECISION \\\\u2014 NON-UPGRADEABLE, single instance.      Policy evolution is meant to happen through governance (the {TimelockController} +      guardian), NOT through code upgrades. Making the contract immutable removes a proxy-admin      key as an attack surface and keeps the storage layout permanently auditable for the      ERC-7562 \\\\\\\"sender-associated storage\\\\\\\" guarantee. The {TimelockController} and the guardian      are injected at construction. If a future hard requirement for logic upgrades appears, the      contract can be re-pointed (deploy v2 + re-authorize the same consumers); a UUPS variant      would gate `_authorizeUpgrade` on `onlyTimelock`.WIRE-FORMAT INVARIANT (Q6): this registry NEVER inspects or packs signature wire-format.      The combined-signature 0x04/05/07 packing is owned entirely by AirAccount #70. Here we      only reason about (sender, target, asset, amount, selector) \\\\u2014 never raw signatures.\\\",\\\"errors\\\":{\\\"SafeCastOverflowedUintDowncast(uint8,uint256)\\\":[{\\\"details\\\":\\\"Value doesn't fit in an uint of `bits` size.\\\"}]},\\\"events\\\":{\\\"PolicyTightened(address,address)\\\":{\\\"details\\\":\\\"Emitted by the immediate tighten path; `actor` is the guardian or the timelock.\\\"}},\\\"kind\\\":\\\"dev\\\",\\\"methods\\\":{\\\"checkPolicy(address,address,address,uint256,bytes4)\\\":{\\\"details\\\":\\\"Reads ONLY `sender`-keyed slots so a staked consumer may call it inside      `validatePaymasterUserOp` / `validateUserOp`. Mirrors SP `_creditExceeded`'s      sender-keyed ceiling pattern.      OPT-IN, default-ALLOW. This registry is an OPT-IN DVT layer, NOT a global      allowlist: a sender with nothing configured for an (asset, target) is UNRESTRICTED      and resolves to ALLOW with `remainingDaily == type(uint256).max`. An explicit      `freeze` is the one hard block (highest priority). Each dimension is enforced ONLY      when it is `configured`; an unconfigured dimension imposes no constraint and never      triggers DVT. Combine: any configured dimension yielding REJECT \\\\u21d2 REJECT; else any      configured dimension yielding REQUIRE_DVT \\\\u21d2 REQUIRE_DVT; else ALLOW.\\\",\\\"params\\\":{\\\"amount\\\":\\\"the asset amount in native units.\\\",\\\"asset\\\":\\\"the ERC-20 whose `amount` is being moved (native units; the ETH sentinel                 `0xEeeeeEeeeEeEeeEeEeEeeEEEeeeeEeeeeeeeEEeE` = ETH). `address(0)` is INVALID                 (reverts ZeroAddress) \\\\u2014 0xEee is the explicit ETH marker (Q4).\\\",\\\"selector\\\":\\\"the function selector being invoked on `target`.\\\",\\\"sender\\\":\\\"the AA account address (the policy + counter key).\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"the contract the op will call.\\\"},\\\"returns\\\":{\\\"decision\\\":\\\"ALLOW / REQUIRE_DVT / REJECT (see {PolicyDecision}).\\\",\\\"remainingDaily\\\":\\\"the asset's remaining native-unit allowance in the current window         AFTER this `amount` would post (0 when REJECT due to a cap; `type(uint256).max` when         the asset is UNRESTRICTED / not configured). Lets the consumer surface \\\\\\\"how much         headroom is left\\\\\\\" without a second call.\\\"}},\\\"constructor\\\":{\\\"params\\\":{\\\"guardian_\\\":\\\"the AirAccount 2-of-3 RecoveryService (immediate tighten/freeze authority).\\\",\\\"initialConsumer\\\":\\\"optional staked consumer to authorize at deploy (address(0) \\\\u21d2 none).\\\",\\\"timelock_\\\":\\\"the OZ TimelockController (loosening + admin authority).\\\"}},\\\"getAssetSpend(address,address)\\\":{\\\"returns\\\":{\\\"spentInWindow\\\":\\\"cumulative native-unit spend in the current window for this asset.\\\",\\\"windowStart\\\":\\\"unix timestamp the current window began.\\\"}},\\\"recordSpend(address,address,address,uint256,bytes4)\\\":{\\\"details\\\":\\\"Same key tuple as {checkPolicy} so per-target velocity can be charged too.      MUST revert if `msg.sender` is not an authorized consumer (see {isAuthorizedConsumer}).      Belt-and-suspenders: even though validation saw a slightly-stale counter, this      authoritative debit closes the drain-then-bypass window (same mitigation philosophy      as SP's postOp credit reconciliation).KNOWN LIMITATION \\\\u2014 TOCTOU (accepted carry-forward, PR #285 round-3): the CUMULATIVE      checks (`dailyLimit`, `velocityLimit`) are read at validation and debited here at      postOp, so multiple ops from the SAME sender in ONE bundle each observe the pre-debit      counter and can collectively overshoot by up to a single bundle's worth \\\\u2014 BOUNDED,      since the next bundle rejects. The PER-TX guards are UNAFFECTED: `perTxHardCap` and      `dvtTriggerAmount` are single-tx comparisons evaluated per op and cannot be bypassed      by bundling (a high-value op still trips its hard cap / still requires DVT). This is      inherent to the ERC-4337 validation/execution split (identical to SP's credit      ceiling). An atomic check-and-debit was evaluated and DEFERRED: it would need a      state-writing validation-time call (ERC-7562 associated-storage risk) plus on-revert      refund logic, and the bounded residual does not justify that complexity.\\\",\\\"params\\\":{\\\"amount\\\":\\\"the asset amount actually spent.\\\",\\\"asset\\\":\\\"the asset spent (native units; ETH sentinel 0xEee\\\\u2026EEeE = ETH; address(0) invalid).\\\",\\\"selector\\\":\\\"the selector invoked.\\\",\\\"sender\\\":\\\"the AA account (counter key).\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"the contract that was called.\\\"}},\\\"setAssetPolicy(address,address,(uint128,uint128,uint256,uint64))\\\":{\\\"details\\\":\\\"Reached only via the timelock's delayed path, so no direction check is needed \\\\u2014      it may loosen or tighten. Immediate tightening uses {tightenAssetPolicy}.\\\"},\\\"setContractScope(address,address,(bool,bool,uint128,uint64,bytes4[]))\\\":{\\\"details\\\":\\\"Selectors are ADDED to the allow set (Q3 additive). Removal is via {tightenContractScope}.\\\"},\\\"tightenAssetPolicy(address,address,(uint128,uint128,uint256,uint64))\\\":{\\\"details\\\":\\\"Tighten = every dimension \\\\u2264 current. Prevents the immediate (no-delay) path from      being abused to loosen. Requires the policy to already be configured.\\\"},\\\"tightenContractScope(address,address,(bool,bool,uint128,uint64,bytes4[]))\\\":{\\\"details\\\":\\\"Tighten = disallow target (true\\\\u2192false ok, false\\\\u2192true forbidden), set requireDVTAlways      (false\\\\u2192true ok, true\\\\u2192false forbidden), lower velocityLimit, and REMOVE the listed      selectors from the allow set. Requires the scope to already be configured.\\\"}},\\\"title\\\":\\\"PolicyRegistry \\\\u2014 sender-keyed, governance-gated DVT trigger / spend policy\\\",\\\"version\\\":1},\\\"userdoc\\\":{\\\"kind\\\":\\\"user\\\",\\\"methods\\\":{\\\"DEFAULT_WINDOW()\\\":{\\\"notice\\\":\\\"Default daily-limit / velocity window when a config leaves `windowSeconds == 0`.\\\"},\\\"ETH_SENTINEL()\\\":{\\\"notice\\\":\\\"Canonical ETH sentinel (Q4). `asset == ETH_SENTINEL` is the valid ETH path;         `asset == address(0)` is INVALID and reverts {ZeroAddress}.\\\"},\\\"checkPolicy(address,address,address,uint256,bytes4)\\\":{\\\"notice\\\":\\\"Validation-time policy decision for one intended action. MUST be `view` and         read only `sender`-associated storage so a staked consumer can call it inside         `validatePaymasterUserOp` / `validateUserOp` without a bundler storage violation.\\\"},\\\"freezeSender(address)\\\":{\\\"notice\\\":\\\"Immediately freeze `sender`: {checkPolicy} returns REJECT for all ops. Immediate         is the whole point \\\\u2014 defense must not wait. `onlyGuardianOrTimelock` (guardian =         AirAccount 2-of-3 RecoveryService). Unfreezing is a loosening \\\\u2192 {unfreezeSender}.\\\"},\\\"guardian()\\\":{\\\"notice\\\":\\\"AirAccount 2-of-3 RecoveryService \\\\u2014 immediate tighten / freeze.\\\"},\\\"recordSpend(address,address,address,uint256,bytes4)\\\":{\\\"notice\\\":\\\"Authoritative spend record. Called AFTER execution (SuperPaymaster `postOp`,         or the account post-call) by an authorized staked consumer. Advances both the         per-asset and per-target sender-keyed counters, rolling the window if elapsed.\\\"},\\\"setAssetPolicy(address,address,(uint128,uint128,uint256,uint64))\\\":{\\\"notice\\\":\\\"Set a (sender, asset) policy. `onlyTimelock` \\\\u2014 reached only after the timelock's         2-day delay, so it may loosen or tighten. `asset` must not be `address(0)`         (use the ETH sentinel for ETH). Emits {AssetPolicySet}.\\\"},\\\"setConsumerAuthorization(address,bool)\\\":{\\\"notice\\\":\\\"Authorize / revoke a staked consumer permitted to call {recordSpend}.         `onlyTimelock`. Only staked EntryPoint entities should be authorized.\\\"},\\\"setContractScope(address,address,(bool,bool,uint128,uint64,bytes4[]))\\\":{\\\"notice\\\":\\\"Set a (sender, target) scope and ADD the listed selectors to the allow set         (Q3: additive). `onlyTimelock`. Emits {ContractScopeSet} + {SelectorScopeSet}.\\\"},\\\"setGuardian(address)\\\":{\\\"notice\\\":\\\"Set the guardian (AirAccount 2-of-3 RecoveryService) that may freeze/tighten.         `onlyTimelock`.\\\"},\\\"tightenAssetPolicy(address,address,(uint128,uint128,uint256,uint64))\\\":{\\\"notice\\\":\\\"Immediately tighten a (sender, asset) policy. MUST revert unless the new params         are \\\\u2264 current on every dimension (NotStrictlyTighter). `onlyGuardianOrTimelock`.\\\"},\\\"tightenContractScope(address,address,(bool,bool,uint128,uint64,bytes4[]))\\\":{\\\"notice\\\":\\\"Immediately tighten a (sender, target) scope (disallow target, remove the listed         selectors, lower velocity, set requireDVTAlways). MUST revert unless tighter.         `onlyGuardianOrTimelock`.\\\"},\\\"timelock()\\\":{\\\"notice\\\":\\\"OZ {TimelockController}; its `minDelay` (= 2 days) gates loosening. Immutable so the         loosening authority can never be silently re-pointed without redeploying.\\\"},\\\"unfreezeSender(address)\\\":{\\\"notice\\\":\\\"Lift a freeze on `sender`. Unfreeze is a loosening \\\\u2192 `onlyTimelock`.\\\"},\\\"version()\\\":{\\\"notice\\\":\\\"Contract version (see CLAUDE.md versioning convention).\\\"}},\\\"notice\\\":\\\"Reference implementation of {IPolicyRegistry}. See the interface for the full design         invariants. This contract is the single on-chain source of truth that staked consumers         (SuperPaymaster #283, AirAccount #70) read during validation, and that DVT nodes /         the slash path reference so that \\\\\\\"what a node enforced == what is punished\\\\\\\".\\\",\\\"version\\\":1}},\\\"settings\\\":{\\\"compilationTarget\\\":{\\\"contracts/src/core/PolicyRegistry.sol\\\":\\\"PolicyRegistry\\\"},\\\"evmVersion\\\":\\\"cancun\\\",\\\"libraries\\\":{},\\\"metadata\\\":{\\\"bytecodeHash\\\":\\\"none\\\"},\\\"optimizer\\\":{\\\"enabled\\\":true,\\\"runs\\\":500},\\\"remappings\\\":[\\\":@account-abstraction-v7/=singleton-paymaster/lib/account-abstraction-v7/contracts/\\\",\\\":@chainlink/contracts/=contracts/lib/chainlink-brownie-contracts/contracts/\\\",\\\":@openzeppelin-v5.0.2/=singleton-paymaster/lib/openzeppelin-contracts-v5.0.2/\\\",\\\":@openzeppelin/contracts/=singleton-paymaster/lib/openzeppelin-contracts-v5.0.2/contracts/\\\",\\\":account-abstraction-v6/=singleton-paymaster/lib/account-abstraction-v6/contracts/\\\",\\\":account-abstraction-v7/=singleton-paymaster/lib/account-abstraction-v7/contracts/\\\",\\\":account-abstraction-v8/=singleton-paymaster/lib/account-abstraction-v8/contracts/\\\",\\\":chainlink-brownie-contracts/=contracts/lib/chainlink-brownie-contracts/contracts/src/v0.6/vendor/@arbitrum/nitro-contracts/src/\\\",\\\":ds-test/=singleton-paymaster/lib/openzeppelin-contracts-v5.0.2/lib/forge-std/lib/ds-test/src/\\\",\\\":erc4626-tests/=singleton-paymaster/lib/openzeppelin-contracts-v5.0.2/lib/erc4626-tests/\\\",\\\":forge-std/=contracts/lib/forge-std/src/\\\",\\\":halmos-cheatcodes/=singleton-paymaster/lib/openzeppelin-contracts-v5.1.0/lib/halmos-cheatcodes/src/\\\",\\\":openzeppelin-contracts-v4.8.3/=singleton-paymaster/lib/openzeppelin-contracts-v4.8.3/\\\",\\\":openzeppelin-contracts-v5.0.2/=singleton-paymaster/lib/openzeppelin-contracts-v5.0.2/\\\",\\\":openzeppelin-contracts-v5.1.0/=singleton-paymaster/lib/openzeppelin-contracts-v5.1.0/\\\",\\\":singleton-paymaster/=singleton-paymaster/\\\",\\\":solady/=contracts/lib/solady/src/\\\",\\\":src/=contracts/src/\\\"],\\\"viaIR\\\":true},\\\"sources\\\":{\\\"contracts/src/core/PolicyRegistry.sol\\\":{\\\"keccak256\\\":\\\"0x0219ca5c425e701eb61f5047a437c1d4dd045a8d3c345298a10ecc98d38dc24a\\\",\\\"license\\\":\\\"Apache-2.0\\\",\\\"urls\\\":[\\\"bzz-raw://05111d482cf309ecfa86cd247d0c1e1257930f87666afc5425b754a2bbbc32cb\\\",\\\"dweb:/ipfs/Qme8zFaMW3ZG1KyW8nwvsmoqfWymyxCERLykE14bhPWjuG\\\"]},\\\"contracts/src/interfaces/v3/IPolicyRegistry.sol\\\":{\\\"keccak256\\\":\\\"0xb6521469758e8349818cb6dfc0cab30f416c76b436f2ae461b6c7391d911070f\\\",\\\"license\\\":\\\"Apache-2.0\\\",\\\"urls\\\":[\\\"bzz-raw://ef4adbe2b5b4ba11b37573c10b2f207a7a0846e2cb0aabf26206a32a09aed54c\\\",\\\"dweb:/ipfs/QmSyKUHUYUaZEk8TfQCf9MM6XAtZuMimqL7khSKTNGH7xw\\\"]},\\\"singleton-paymaster/lib/openzeppelin-contracts-v5.0.2/contracts/utils/math/SafeCast.sol\\\":{\\\"keccak256\\\":\\\"0xe19a4d5f31d2861e7344e8e535e2feafb913d806d3e2b5fe7782741a2a7094fe\\\",\\\"license\\\":\\\"MIT\\\",\\\"urls\\\":[\\\"bzz-raw://4aed79c0fa6f0546ed02f2f683e8f77f0fd2ed7eb34d8bbf3d373c9a6d95b13c\\\",\\\"dweb:/ipfs/QmWqVz6UAVqmnWU5pqYPt1o6iDEZyPaBraAA3rKfTTSfYj\\\"]}},\\\"version\\\":1}\",\"metadata\":{\"compiler\":{\"version\":\"0.8.33+commit.64118f21\"},\"language\":\"Solidity\",\"output\":{\"abi\":[{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"timelock_\",\"type\":\"address\"},{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"guardian_\",\"type\":\"address\"},{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"initialConsumer\",\"type\":\"address\"}],\"stateMutability\":\"nonpayable\",\"type\":\"constructor\"},{\"inputs\":[],\"type\":\"error\",\"name\":\"NotAuthorizedConsumer\"},{\"inputs\":[],\"type\":\"error\",\"name\":\"NotGuardianOrTimelock\"},{\"inputs\":[],\"type\":\"error\",\"name\":\"NotStrictlyTighter\"},{\"inputs\":[],\"type\":\"error\",\"name\":\"NotTimelock\"},{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"uint8\",\"name\":\"bits\",\"type\":\"uint8\"},{\"internalType\":\"uint256\",\"name\":\"value\",\"type\":\"uint256\"}],\"type\":\"error\",\"name\":\"SafeCastOverflowedUintDowncast\"},{\"inputs\":[],\"type\":\"error\",\"name\":\"SenderIsFrozen\"},{\"inputs\":[],\"type\":\"error\",\"name\":\"ZeroAddress\"},{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"sender\",\"type\":\"address\",\"indexed\":true},{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"asset\",\"type\":\"address\",\"indexed\":true},{\"internalType\":\"uint128\",\"name\":\"dvtTriggerAmount\",\"type\":\"uint128\",\"indexed\":false},{\"internalType\":\"uint128\",\"name\":\"perTxHardCap\",\"type\":\"uint128\",\"indexed\":false},{\"internalType\":\"uint256\",\"name\":\"dailyLimit\",\"type\":\"uint256\",\"indexed\":false}],\"type\":\"event\",\"name\":\"AssetPolicySet\",\"anonymous\":false},{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"consumer\",\"type\":\"address\",\"indexed\":true},{\"internalType\":\"bool\",\"name\":\"authorized\",\"type\":\"bool\",\"indexed\":false}],\"type\":\"event\",\"name\":\"ConsumerAuthorizationSet\",\"anonymous\":false},{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"sender\",\"type\":\"address\",\"indexed\":true},{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"target\",\"type\":\"address\",\"indexed\":true},{\"internalType\":\"bool\",\"name\":\"allowed\",\"type\":\"bool\",\"indexed\":false},{\"internalType\":\"bool\",\"name\":\"requireDVTAlways\",\"type\":\"bool\",\"indexed\":false},{\"internalType\":\"uint128\",\"name\":\"velocityLimit\",\"type\":\"uint128\",\"indexed\":false},{\"internalType\":\"uint64\",\"name\":\"velocityWindow\",\"type\":\"uint64\",\"indexed\":false}],\"type\":\"event\",\"name\":\"ContractScopeSet\",\"anonymous\":false},{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"oldGuardian\",\"type\":\"address\",\"indexed\":true},{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"newGuardian\",\"type\":\"address\",\"indexed\":true}],\"type\":\"event\",\"name\":\"GuardianUpdated\",\"anonymous\":false},{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"sender\",\"type\":\"address\",\"indexed\":true},{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"actor\",\"type\":\"address\",\"indexed\":true}],\"type\":\"event\",\"name\":\"PolicyTightened\",\"anonymous\":false},{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"sender\",\"type\":\"address\",\"indexed\":true},{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"target\",\"type\":\"address\",\"indexed\":true},{\"internalType\":\"bytes4\",\"name\":\"selector\",\"type\":\"bytes4\",\"indexed\":true},{\"internalType\":\"bool\",\"name\":\"allowed\",\"type\":\"bool\",\"indexed\":false}],\"type\":\"event\",\"name\":\"SelectorScopeSet\",\"anonymous\":false},{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"sender\",\"type\":\"address\",\"indexed\":true},{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"actor\",\"type\":\"address\",\"indexed\":true}],\"type\":\"event\",\"name\":\"SenderFrozen\",\"anonymous\":false},{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"sender\",\"type\":\"address\",\"indexed\":true}],\"type\":\"event\",\"name\":\"SenderUnfrozen\",\"anonymous\":false},{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"sender\",\"type\":\"address\",\"indexed\":true},{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"asset\",\"type\":\"address\",\"indexed\":true},{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"target\",\"type\":\"address\",\"indexed\":true},{\"internalType\":\"uint256\",\"name\":\"amount\",\"type\":\"uint256\",\"indexed\":false},{\"internalType\":\"bytes4\",\"name\":\"selector\",\"type\":\"bytes4\",\"indexed\":false}],\"type\":\"event\",\"name\":\"SpendRecorded\",\"anonymous\":false},{\"inputs\":[],\"stateMutability\":\"view\",\"type\":\"function\",\"name\":\"DEFAULT_WINDOW\",\"outputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"uint64\",\"name\":\"\",\"type\":\"uint64\"}]},{\"inputs\":[],\"stateMutability\":\"view\",\"type\":\"function\",\"name\":\"ETH_SENTINEL\",\"outputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"\",\"type\":\"address\"}]},{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"sender\",\"type\":\"address\"},{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"target\",\"type\":\"address\"},{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"asset\",\"type\":\"address\"},{\"internalType\":\"uint256\",\"name\":\"amount\",\"type\":\"uint256\"},{\"internalType\":\"bytes4\",\"name\":\"selector\",\"type\":\"bytes4\"}],\"stateMutability\":\"view\",\"type\":\"function\",\"name\":\"checkPolicy\",\"outputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"enum IPolicyRegistry.PolicyDecision\",\"name\":\"decision\",\"type\":\"uint8\"},{\"internalType\":\"uint256\",\"name\":\"remainingDaily\",\"type\":\"uint256\"}]},{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"sender\",\"type\":\"address\"}],\"stateMutability\":\"nonpayable\",\"type\":\"function\",\"name\":\"freezeSender\"},{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"sender\",\"type\":\"address\"},{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"asset\",\"type\":\"address\"}],\"stateMutability\":\"view\",\"type\":\"function\",\"name\":\"getAssetPolicy\",\"outputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"struct IPolicyRegistry.AssetPolicy\",\"name\":\"\",\"type\":\"tuple\",\"components\":[{\"internalType\":\"uint128\",\"name\":\"dvtTriggerAmount\",\"type\":\"uint128\"},{\"internalType\":\"uint128\",\"name\":\"perTxHardCap\",\"type\":\"uint128\"},{\"internalType\":\"uint256\",\"name\":\"dailyLimit\",\"type\":\"uint256\"},{\"internalType\":\"uint64\",\"name\":\"windowSeconds\",\"type\":\"uint64\"},{\"internalType\":\"bool\",\"name\":\"configured\",\"type\":\"bool\"}]}]},{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"sender\",\"type\":\"address\"},{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"asset\",\"type\":\"address\"}],\"stateMutability\":\"view\",\"type\":\"function\",\"name\":\"getAssetSpend\",\"outputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"uint128\",\"name\":\"spentInWindow\",\"type\":\"uint128\"},{\"internalType\":\"uint64\",\"name\":\"windowStart\",\"type\":\"uint64\"}]},{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"sender\",\"type\":\"address\"},{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"target\",\"type\":\"address\"}],\"stateMutability\":\"view\",\"type\":\"function\",\"name\":\"getContractScope\",\"outputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"struct IPolicyRegistry.ContractScope\",\"name\":\"\",\"type\":\"tuple\",\"components\":[{\"internalType\":\"bool\",\"name\":\"allowed\",\"type\":\"bool\"},{\"internalType\":\"bool\",\"name\":\"requireDVTAlways\",\"type\":\"bool\"},{\"internalType\":\"uint128\",\"name\":\"velocityLimit\",\"type\":\"uint128\"},{\"internalType\":\"uint64\",\"name\":\"velocityWindow\",\"type\":\"uint64\"},{\"internalType\":\"bool\",\"name\":\"configured\",\"type\":\"bool\"}]}]},{\"inputs\":[],\"stateMutability\":\"view\",\"type\":\"function\",\"name\":\"guardian\",\"outputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"\",\"type\":\"address\"}]},{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"consumer\",\"type\":\"address\"}],\"stateMutability\":\"view\",\"type\":\"function\",\"name\":\"isAuthorizedConsumer\",\"outputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"bool\",\"name\":\"\",\"type\":\"bool\"}]},{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"sender\",\"type\":\"address\"}],\"stateMutability\":\"view\",\"type\":\"function\",\"name\":\"isFrozen\",\"outputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"bool\",\"name\":\"\",\"type\":\"bool\"}]},{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"sender\",\"type\":\"address\"},{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"target\",\"type\":\"address\"},{\"internalType\":\"bytes4\",\"name\":\"selector\",\"type\":\"bytes4\"}],\"stateMutability\":\"view\",\"type\":\"function\",\"name\":\"isSelectorAllowed\",\"outputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"bool\",\"name\":\"\",\"type\":\"bool\"}]},{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"sender\",\"type\":\"address\"},{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"target\",\"type\":\"address\"},{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"asset\",\"type\":\"address\"},{\"internalType\":\"uint256\",\"name\":\"amount\",\"type\":\"uint256\"},{\"internalType\":\"bytes4\",\"name\":\"selector\",\"type\":\"bytes4\"}],\"stateMutability\":\"nonpayable\",\"type\":\"function\",\"name\":\"recordSpend\"},{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"sender\",\"type\":\"address\"},{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"asset\",\"type\":\"address\"},{\"internalType\":\"struct IPolicyRegistry.AssetPolicyInput\",\"name\":\"params\",\"type\":\"tuple\",\"components\":[{\"internalType\":\"uint128\",\"name\":\"dvtTriggerAmount\",\"type\":\"uint128\"},{\"internalType\":\"uint128\",\"name\":\"perTxHardCap\",\"type\":\"uint128\"},{\"internalType\":\"uint256\",\"name\":\"dailyLimit\",\"type\":\"uint256\"},{\"internalType\":\"uint64\",\"name\":\"windowSeconds\",\"type\":\"uint64\"}]}],\"stateMutability\":\"nonpayable\",\"type\":\"function\",\"name\":\"setAssetPolicy\"},{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"consumer\",\"type\":\"address\"},{\"internalType\":\"bool\",\"name\":\"authorized\",\"type\":\"bool\"}],\"stateMutability\":\"nonpayable\",\"type\":\"function\",\"name\":\"setConsumerAuthorization\"},{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"sender\",\"type\":\"address\"},{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"target\",\"type\":\"address\"},{\"internalType\":\"struct IPolicyRegistry.ContractScopeInput\",\"name\":\"params\",\"type\":\"tuple\",\"components\":[{\"internalType\":\"bool\",\"name\":\"allowed\",\"type\":\"bool\"},{\"internalType\":\"bool\",\"name\":\"requireDVTAlways\",\"type\":\"bool\"},{\"internalType\":\"uint128\",\"name\":\"velocityLimit\",\"type\":\"uint128\"},{\"internalType\":\"uint64\",\"name\":\"velocityWindow\",\"type\":\"uint64\"},{\"internalType\":\"bytes4[]\",\"name\":\"selectorAllowlist\",\"type\":\"bytes4[]\"}]}],\"stateMutability\":\"nonpayable\",\"type\":\"function\",\"name\":\"setContractScope\"},{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"newGuardian\",\"type\":\"address\"}],\"stateMutability\":\"nonpayable\",\"type\":\"function\",\"name\":\"setGuardian\"},{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"sender\",\"type\":\"address\"},{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"asset\",\"type\":\"address\"},{\"internalType\":\"struct IPolicyRegistry.AssetPolicyInput\",\"name\":\"params\",\"type\":\"tuple\",\"components\":[{\"internalType\":\"uint128\",\"name\":\"dvtTriggerAmount\",\"type\":\"uint128\"},{\"internalType\":\"uint128\",\"name\":\"perTxHardCap\",\"type\":\"uint128\"},{\"internalType\":\"uint256\",\"name\":\"dailyLimit\",\"type\":\"uint256\"},{\"internalType\":\"uint64\",\"name\":\"windowSeconds\",\"type\":\"uint64\"}]}],\"stateMutability\":\"nonpayable\",\"type\":\"function\",\"name\":\"tightenAssetPolicy\"},{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"sender\",\"type\":\"address\"},{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"target\",\"type\":\"address\"},{\"internalType\":\"struct IPolicyRegistry.ContractScopeInput\",\"name\":\"params\",\"type\":\"tuple\",\"components\":[{\"internalType\":\"bool\",\"name\":\"allowed\",\"type\":\"bool\"},{\"internalType\":\"bool\",\"name\":\"requireDVTAlways\",\"type\":\"bool\"},{\"internalType\":\"uint128\",\"name\":\"velocityLimit\",\"type\":\"uint128\"},{\"internalType\":\"uint64\",\"name\":\"velocityWindow\",\"type\":\"uint64\"},{\"internalType\":\"bytes4[]\",\"name\":\"selectorAllowlist\",\"type\":\"bytes4[]\"}]}],\"stateMutability\":\"nonpayable\",\"type\":\"function\",\"name\":\"tightenContractScope\"},{\"inputs\":[],\"stateMutability\":\"view\",\"type\":\"function\",\"name\":\"timelock\",\"outputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"\",\"type\":\"address\"}]},{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"sender\",\"type\":\"address\"}],\"stateMutability\":\"nonpayable\",\"type\":\"function\",\"name\":\"unfreezeSender\"},{\"inputs\":[],\"stateMutability\":\"pure\",\"type\":\"function\",\"name\":\"version\",\"outputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"string\",\"name\":\"\",\"type\":\"string\"}]}],\"devdoc\":{\"kind\":\"dev\",\"methods\":{\"checkPolicy(address,address,address,uint256,bytes4)\":{\"details\":\"Reads ONLY `sender`-keyed slots so a staked consumer may call it inside      `validatePaymasterUserOp` / `validateUserOp`. Mirrors SP `_creditExceeded`'s      sender-keyed ceiling pattern.      OPT-IN, default-ALLOW. This registry is an OPT-IN DVT layer, NOT a global      allowlist: a sender with nothing configured for an (asset, target) is UNRESTRICTED      and resolves to ALLOW with `remainingDaily == type(uint256).max`. An explicit      `freeze` is the one hard block (highest priority). Each dimension is enforced ONLY      when it is `configured`; an unconfigured dimension imposes no constraint and never      triggers DVT. Combine: any configured dimension yielding REJECT ⇒ REJECT; else any      configured dimension yielding REQUIRE_DVT ⇒ REQUIRE_DVT; else ALLOW.\",\"params\":{\"amount\":\"the asset amount in native units.\",\"asset\":\"the ERC-20 whose `amount` is being moved (native units; the ETH sentinel                 `0xEeeeeEeeeEeEeeEeEeEeeEEEeeeeEeeeeeeeEEeE` = ETH). `address(0)` is INVALID                 (reverts ZeroAddress) — 0xEee is the explicit ETH marker (Q4).\",\"selector\":\"the function selector being invoked on `target`.\",\"sender\":\"the AA account address (the policy + counter key).\",\"target\":\"the contract the op will call.\"},\"returns\":{\"decision\":\"ALLOW / REQUIRE_DVT / REJECT (see {PolicyDecision}).\",\"remainingDaily\":\"the asset's remaining native-unit allowance in the current window         AFTER this `amount` would post (0 when REJECT due to a cap; `type(uint256).max` when         the asset is UNRESTRICTED / not configured). Lets the consumer surface \\\"how much         headroom is left\\\" without a second call.\"}},\"constructor\":{\"params\":{\"guardian_\":\"the AirAccount 2-of-3 RecoveryService (immediate tighten/freeze authority).\",\"initialConsumer\":\"optional staked consumer to authorize at deploy (address(0) ⇒ none).\",\"timelock_\":\"the OZ TimelockController (loosening + admin authority).\"}},\"getAssetSpend(address,address)\":{\"returns\":{\"spentInWindow\":\"cumulative native-unit spend in the current window for this asset.\",\"windowStart\":\"unix timestamp the current window began.\"}},\"recordSpend(address,address,address,uint256,bytes4)\":{\"details\":\"Same key tuple as {checkPolicy} so per-target velocity can be charged too.      MUST revert if `msg.sender` is not an authorized consumer (see {isAuthorizedConsumer}).      Belt-and-suspenders: even though validation saw a slightly-stale counter, this      authoritative debit closes the drain-then-bypass window (same mitigation philosophy      as SP's postOp credit reconciliation).KNOWN LIMITATION — TOCTOU (accepted carry-forward, PR #285 round-3): the CUMULATIVE      checks (`dailyLimit`, `velocityLimit`) are read at validation and debited here at      postOp, so multiple ops from the SAME sender in ONE bundle each observe the pre-debit      counter and can collectively overshoot by up to a single bundle's worth — BOUNDED,      since the next bundle rejects. The PER-TX guards are UNAFFECTED: `perTxHardCap` and      `dvtTriggerAmount` are single-tx comparisons evaluated per op and cannot be bypassed      by bundling (a high-value op still trips its hard cap / still requires DVT). This is      inherent to the ERC-4337 validation/execution split (identical to SP's credit      ceiling). An atomic check-and-debit was evaluated and DEFERRED: it would need a      state-writing validation-time call (ERC-7562 associated-storage risk) plus on-revert      refund logic, and the bounded residual does not justify that complexity.\",\"params\":{\"amount\":\"the asset amount actually spent.\",\"asset\":\"the asset spent (native units; ETH sentinel 0xEee…EEeE = ETH; address(0) invalid).\",\"selector\":\"the selector invoked.\",\"sender\":\"the AA account (counter key).\",\"target\":\"the contract that was called.\"}},\"setAssetPolicy(address,address,(uint128,uint128,uint256,uint64))\":{\"details\":\"Reached only via the timelock's delayed path, so no direction check is needed —      it may loosen or tighten. Immediate tightening uses {tightenAssetPolicy}.\"},\"setContractScope(address,address,(bool,bool,uint128,uint64,bytes4[]))\":{\"details\":\"Selectors are ADDED to the allow set (Q3 additive). Removal is via {tightenContractScope}.\"},\"tightenAssetPolicy(address,address,(uint128,uint128,uint256,uint64))\":{\"details\":\"Tighten = every dimension ≤ current. Prevents the immediate (no-delay) path from      being abused to loosen. Requires the policy to already be configured.\"},\"tightenContractScope(address,address,(bool,bool,uint128,uint64,bytes4[]))\":{\"details\":\"Tighten = disallow target (true→false ok, false→true forbidden), set requireDVTAlways      (false→true ok, true→false forbidden), lower velocityLimit, and REMOVE the listed      selectors from the allow set. Requires the scope to already be configured.\"}},\"version\":1},\"userdoc\":{\"kind\":\"user\",\"methods\":{\"DEFAULT_WINDOW()\":{\"notice\":\"Default daily-limit / velocity window when a config leaves `windowSeconds == 0`.\"},\"ETH_SENTINEL()\":{\"notice\":\"Canonical ETH sentinel (Q4). `asset == ETH_SENTINEL` is the valid ETH path;         `asset == address(0)` is INVALID and reverts {ZeroAddress}.\"},\"checkPolicy(address,address,address,uint256,bytes4)\":{\"notice\":\"Validation-time policy decision for one intended action. MUST be `view` and         read only `sender`-associated storage so a staked consumer can call it inside         `validatePaymasterUserOp` / `validateUserOp` without a bundler storage violation.\"},\"freezeSender(address)\":{\"notice\":\"Immediately freeze `sender`: {checkPolicy} returns REJECT for all ops. Immediate         is the whole point — defense must not wait. `onlyGuardianOrTimelock` (guardian =         AirAccount 2-of-3 RecoveryService). Unfreezing is a loosening → {unfreezeSender}.\"},\"guardian()\":{\"notice\":\"AirAccount 2-of-3 RecoveryService — immediate tighten / freeze.\"},\"recordSpend(address,address,address,uint256,bytes4)\":{\"notice\":\"Authoritative spend record. Called AFTER execution (SuperPaymaster `postOp`,         or the account post-call) by an authorized staked consumer. Advances both the         per-asset and per-target sender-keyed counters, rolling the window if elapsed.\"},\"setAssetPolicy(address,address,(uint128,uint128,uint256,uint64))\":{\"notice\":\"Set a (sender, asset) policy. `onlyTimelock` — reached only after the timelock's         2-day delay, so it may loosen or tighten. `asset` must not be `address(0)`         (use the ETH sentinel for ETH). Emits {AssetPolicySet}.\"},\"setConsumerAuthorization(address,bool)\":{\"notice\":\"Authorize / revoke a staked consumer permitted to call {recordSpend}.         `onlyTimelock`. Only staked EntryPoint entities should be authorized.\"},\"setContractScope(address,address,(bool,bool,uint128,uint64,bytes4[]))\":{\"notice\":\"Set a (sender, target) scope and ADD the listed selectors to the allow set         (Q3: additive). `onlyTimelock`. Emits {ContractScopeSet} + {SelectorScopeSet}.\"},\"setGuardian(address)\":{\"notice\":\"Set the guardian (AirAccount 2-of-3 RecoveryService) that may freeze/tighten.         `onlyTimelock`.\"},\"tightenAssetPolicy(address,address,(uint128,uint128,uint256,uint64))\":{\"notice\":\"Immediately tighten a (sender, asset) policy. MUST revert unless the new params         are ≤ current on every dimension (NotStrictlyTighter). `onlyGuardianOrTimelock`.\"},\"tightenContractScope(address,address,(bool,bool,uint128,uint64,bytes4[]))\":{\"notice\":\"Immediately tighten a (sender, target) scope (disallow target, remove the listed         selectors, lower velocity, set requireDVTAlways). MUST revert unless tighter.         `onlyGuardianOrTimelock`.\"},\"timelock()\":{\"notice\":\"OZ {TimelockController}; its `minDelay` (= 2 days) gates loosening. Immutable so the         loosening authority can never be silently re-pointed without redeploying.\"},\"unfreezeSender(address)\":{\"notice\":\"Lift a freeze on `sender`. Unfreeze is a loosening → `onlyTimelock`.\"},\"version()\":{\"notice\":\"Contract version (see CLAUDE.md versioning convention).\"}},\"version\":1}},\"settings\":{\"remappings\":[\"@account-abstraction-v7/=singleton-paymaster/lib/account-abstraction-v7/contracts/\",\"@chainlink/contracts/=contracts/lib/chainlink-brownie-contracts/contracts/\",\"@openzeppelin-v5.0.2/=singleton-paymaster/lib/openzeppelin-contracts-v5.0.2/\",\"@openzeppelin/contracts/=singleton-paymaster/lib/openzeppelin-contracts-v5.0.2/contracts/\",\"account-abstraction-v6/=singleton-